  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.03 Applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.03 “Applicant” means an entity that files an eligibility request or a final application, or both, for financial assistance from the PFAS RLF.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
